            <title>[ZEPPELIN-428] Support Python programmatic access to dynamic form</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-428</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This is great feedback from the local Zeppelin community.&lt;br/&gt;
People are going to Scala to programmatically access ZeppelinContext z.input() and z.select(), and then passing back to Python to use in their code.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Having these available in Python would be much more simple.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
